<h3>Recommended Framework: SPICED</h3>
<p>SPICED (Situation, Pain, Impact, Critical Event, Decision) fits Alphabot=
's SMB/mid-market motion better than MEDDICC (too enterprise-heavy) or BANT=
 (too transactional).</p>

<div class=3D"tbl-wrap"><table>
<tbody><tr><th>Letter</th><th>Question Type</th><th>Discovery Questions for=
 Alphabot</th></tr>
<tr><td><strong>S</strong> =E2=80=94 Situation</td><td>Understand current s=
tate</td><td>"How many WhatsApp messages does your team receive per day?" /=
 "How many people manage your WhatsApp right now?" / "Which tools do you us=
e today for customer communication?"</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>P</strong> =E2=80=94 Pain</td><td>Surface the real problem<=
/td><td>"What happens to messages that come in after 6 PM?" / "How long doe=
s it typically take your team to respond?" / "Have you lost customers becau=
se of slow WhatsApp response?"</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>I</strong> =E2=80=94 Impact</td><td>Quantify the pain</td><=
td>"How much time per day does your team spend on repetitive WhatsApp queri=
es?" / "What would a 30-second response time vs. 4 hours mean for your conv=
ersion rate?" / "If you recovered 20% more leads from WhatsApp, what would =
that mean for monthly revenue?"</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>C</strong> =E2=80=94 Critical Event</td><td>Find the forcin=
g function</td><td>"Is there a product launch, festive season, or expansion=
 planned where volume will spike?" / "Is your team stretched heading into Q=
4?" / "Are you aware of the DPDPA compliance requirements coming in 2027?"<=
/td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>E</strong> =E2=80=94 Decision</td><td>Map the buying proces=
s</td><td>"If we build a trial for your WhatsApp number this week, who else=
 needs to see it before a decision?" / "Is budget something you control, or=
 does it require approval?" / "What would a successful first 30 days look l=
ike for you?"</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>

